---
description: Require .js suffixes on relative imports in api and places-core (NodeNext)
globs: apps/api/**/*.ts,packages/places-core/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# API / core ESM import extensions

- Relative TypeScript imports **must** use `.js` suffixes (NodeNext emit), e.g. `from "./create-app.js"`.
- Do **not** use extensionless relative imports in `apps/api` or `packages/places-core`.
- Package imports (`places-core`, `node:http`, `vitest`) stay bare as today.
